00:00:12.138 --> 00:00:14.173
&gt;&gt; Bret: IN TONIGHT'S

00:00:13.072 --> 00:00:16.976
WHATEVER HAPPENED TO

00:00:14.306 --> 00:00:18.511
SEGMENT, THE AIDS EPIDEMIC.

00:00:17.109 --> 00:00:19.845
MIKE TWEETS THE DISEASE

00:00:18.644 --> 00:00:21.113
DOMINATED THE NEWS IN THE

00:00:19.979 --> 00:00:23.449
80'S AND 90'S.

00:00:21.247 --> 00:00:24.183
HOW FAR HAVE WE COME SINCE

00:00:23.582 --> 00:00:26.085
THEN?

00:00:24.316 --> 00:00:28.754
WELL, MIKE, TONIGHT MIKE

00:00:26.218 --> 00:00:29.822
EMANUEL HAS SOME ANSWERS.

00:00:28.954 --> 00:00:31.323
&gt;&gt; AMERICA FACES A DISEASE

00:00:29.955 --> 00:00:33.592
THAT IS FATAL AND SPREADING

00:00:31.457 --> 00:00:33.993
AND THIS CALLS FOR URGENCY,

00:00:33.726 --> 00:00:35.728
NOT PANIC.

00:00:34.126 --> 00:00:37.129
&gt;&gt; THERE WAS A TIME BACK IN

00:00:35.861 --> 00:00:38.764
THE 1980S WHEN A DIAGNOSIS

00:00:37.263 --> 00:00:39.131
OF H.I.V. WAS A DEATH

00:00:38.898 --> 00:00:43.068
SENTENCE.

00:00:39.265 --> 00:00:43.802
&gt;&gt; THE SURVIVAL WAS A YEAR

00:00:43.202 --> 00:00:45.804
TO YEAR AND A HALF.

00:00:43.936 --> 00:00:46.772
WHICH MEANT THAT 50% OF MY

00:00:45.938 --> 00:00:47.706
PATIENTS WOULD BE DEAD IN A

00:00:46.906 --> 00:00:49.575
YEAR TO A YEAR AND A HALF.

00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:51.010
&gt;&gt; MORE THAN 35 YEARS LATER,

00:00:49.708 --> 00:00:52.945
IT'S RARE TO HEAR ABOUT THE

00:00:51.143 --> 00:00:53.846
VIRUS EVEN THOUGH MORE THAN

00:00:53.078 --> 00:00:55.181
1.1 MILLION PEOPLE ARE

00:00:53.979 --> 00:00:56.515
LIVING IN THE U.S. WITH

00:00:55.314 --> 00:00:58.617
H.I.V. TODAY.

00:00:56.649 --> 00:01:00.219
ONE OF THE HIGHEST PROFILE

00:00:58.751 --> 00:01:01.187
SURVIVORS IS BASKETBALL

00:01:00.352 --> 00:01:02.588
GREAT MAGIC JOHNSON WHO

00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:05.724
STUNNED THE WORLD WITH THIS

00:01:02.721 --> 00:01:06.759
ANNOUNCEMENT BACK IN 1991.

00:01:05.925 --> 00:01:09.128
&gt;&gt; SOMETIME WE THINK ONLY

00:01:06.892 --> 00:01:10.095
GAY PEOPLE CAN GET IT.

00:01:09.261 --> 00:01:10.896
ONLY IT'S NOT GOING TO

00:01:10.229 --> 00:01:12.631
HAPPEN TO ME.

00:01:11.030 --> 00:01:13.532
AND HERE I AM SAYING IT CAN

00:01:12.765 --> 00:01:14.934
HAPPEN TO ANYBODY.

00:01:13.666 --> 00:01:15.768
EVEN ME, MAGIC JOHNSON.

00:01:15.067 --> 00:01:18.504
IT CAN HAPPEN.

00:01:15.901 --> 00:01:20.406
&gt;&gt; DR. ANTHONY FOUCHY HAS

00:01:18.637 --> 00:01:21.941
ADVISED FIVE PRESIDENTS ON

00:01:20.539 --> 00:01:22.408
H.I.V. AIDS AND OTHER GLOBAL

00:01:22.074 --> 00:01:24.276
HEALTH ISSUES.

00:01:22.541 --> 00:01:24.944
&gt;&gt; IN 1996 THAT WAS THE

00:01:24.410 --> 00:01:26.412
WATERSHED MOMENT.

00:01:25.077 --> 00:01:28.380
WHEN THE COMBINATIONS OF

00:01:26.545 --> 00:01:31.383
DRUGS WAS SHOWN TO DECREASE

00:01:28.514 --> 00:01:32.084
THE LEVEL OF VIRUS TO BELOW

00:01:31.517 --> 00:01:33.452
DETECTABLE LEVELS.

00:01:32.218 --> 00:01:36.155
AND TO KEEP THEM THERE.

00:01:33.586 --> 00:01:37.656
&gt;&gt; IN 2003, PRESIDENT GEORGE

00:01:36.288 --> 00:01:38.691
W. BUSH LAUNCHED THE

00:01:37.790 --> 00:01:41.994
PRESIDENT'S EMERGENCY PLAN

00:01:38.824 --> 00:01:43.996
FOR AIDS RELIEF RECOGNIZING

00:01:42.127 --> 00:01:45.364
THE H.I.V. AIDS PANDEMIC

00:01:44.129 --> 00:01:47.299
THREATEN TO WIPE OUT AN

00:01:45.497 --> 00:01:48.300
ENTIRE GENERATION IN AFRICA.

00:01:47.499 --> 00:01:49.235
&gt;&gt; SELDOM HAS HISTORY

00:01:48.434 --> 00:01:51.170
OFFERED A GREATER

00:01:49.368 --> 00:01:53.505
OPPORTUNITY TO DO SO MUCH

00:01:51.303 --> 00:01:55.107
FOR SO MANY.

00:01:53.639 --> 00:01:56.575
WE HAVE CONFRONTED AND WILL

00:01:55.241 --> 00:01:58.777
CONTINUE TO CONFRONT H.I.V.

00:01:56.709 --> 00:02:01.780
AIDS IN OUR OWN COUNTRY AND

00:01:58.911 --> 00:02:03.215
TO MEET A SEVERE AND URGENT

00:02:01.914 --> 00:02:04.516
CRISIS ABROAD TONIGHT I PLAN

00:02:03.349 --> 00:02:04.850
THE EMERGENCY PLAN FOR AIDS

00:02:04.650 --> 00:02:08.120
RELIEF.

00:02:04.984 --> 00:02:10.222
&gt;&gt; ROCK STAR BONO FROM U2

00:02:08.254 --> 00:02:12.358
GAVE MR. BUSH CREDIT FOR

00:02:10.356 --> 00:02:13.626
SAVING MILLIONS OF LIVES.

00:02:12.491 --> 00:02:15.094
INVESTMENT HAS DELIVERED.

00:02:13.826 --> 00:02:15.527
&gt;&gt; ENTIRE COMMUNITIES WERE

00:02:15.227 --> 00:02:16.428
DISSEMINATED.

00:02:15.661 --> 00:02:17.563
CHILDREN WERE LIVING WITHOUT

00:02:16.562 --> 00:02:18.631
MOTHERS AND FATHERS U

00:02:17.696 --> 00:02:19.231
SCHOOLS WENT WITHOUT

00:02:18.764 --> 00:02:20.099
TEACHERS.

00:02:19.365 --> 00:02:21.834
HOSPITALS WENT WITHOUT

00:02:20.232 --> 00:02:23.168
NURSES AND DOCTORS.

00:02:21.967 --> 00:02:25.204
AND TODAY IN THOSE SAME

00:02:23.302 --> 00:02:25.771
AREAS WE HAVE NEARLY

00:02:25.337 --> 00:02:30.843
13 MILLION PEOPLE ON

00:02:25.904 --> 00:02:31.944
TREATMENT BECAUSE OF.

00:02:31.043 --> 00:02:33.779
&gt;&gt; PRESIDENT OBAMA NOTICED

00:02:32.077 --> 00:02:34.913
THE INCREDIBLE TOOLS

00:02:33.912 --> 00:02:35.681
AVAILABLE TO PREVENT AND

00:02:35.047 --> 00:02:37.449
TREAT INFECTION.

00:02:35.881 --> 00:02:39.018
&gt;&gt; WHAT ONCE SEEMED LIKE AN

00:02:37.583 --> 00:02:40.786
IMPOSSIBLE DREAM, THE DREAM

00:02:39.151 --> 00:02:41.820
OF AN AIDS-FREE GENERATION

00:02:40.919 --> 00:02:43.188
IS WITHIN OUR GRASP.

00:02:41.954 --> 00:02:44.023
&gt;&gt; DR. FOUCHY SAYS THE

00:02:43.322 --> 00:02:45.524
UNITED STATES MUST AT THIS

00:02:44.156 --> 00:02:47.726
POINT TO LEAD BECAUSE THE

00:02:45.658 --> 00:02:49.361
FIGHT ISN'T OVER YET.

00:02:47.926 --> 00:02:50.829
&gt;&gt; THE FINAL HOLY GRAIL THAT

00:02:49.495 --> 00:02:52.431
WE'RE WORKING VERY HARD ON

00:02:50.963 --> 00:02:53.532
IS AN H.I.V. VACCINE.

00:02:52.564 --> 00:02:55.501
SO IF YOU LOOK AT EVERYTHING

00:02:53.666 --> 00:02:57.903
THAT'S HAPPENED FROM 1981 TO

00:02:55.634 --> 00:02:59.338
TODAY IN 2018, IF WE GET

00:02:58.037 --> 00:03:01.740
THAT VACCINE, THAT WOULD BE

00:02:59.471 --> 00:03:02.041
THE NAIL IN THE COFFIN OF

